(:room
 :id "ending-player-led"
 :title "Player-Led Solution"
 :body
 ((:p "\"Alfred Inglethorp and Evelyn Howard,\" you say. \"The medicine carried the poison; the chemist's purchase was staged; and Alfred hid the alibi that would have saved him too soon.\" Poirot lets the silence do the rest.")
  (:p "Rank: Brilliant.")))
